todo - personal offline task app

  Website: https://todo.gharawi.sa
  App:     https://todo.gharawi.sa/app/

  todo -h          show this help
  todo status      show the Todo container's current state
  todo health      check the public HTTPS health endpoint
  todo logs        show the last 50 container log lines
  todo backup      create and integrity-check today's SQLite backup
  todo backups     list the retained daily backup files

  Tasks, nested subtasks, colored lists, folders, tags, notes, dates,
  priorities, recurring tasks and private sync work on phone and desktop.
  Habits, reminder delivery and a full focus workflow are not ready.
  Use the install button; on iPhone use Safari Share > Add to Home Screen.

  Sync credential: /opt/gharawi-todo/.env (TODO_SYNC_TOKEN).
  Keep this token private; enter it in Connect private sync on your device.
  Service files and data: /opt/gharawi-todo
  Caddy configuration: todo.caddy in your proxy's imported configuration directory
  Daily backup schedule: /etc/cron.d/gharawi-todo-backup
  Seven daily backups are retained on this VPS, not off-server.

  Never copy only the live todo.db file: outstanding writes may be in its WAL.
  Use `todo backup` for a consistent copy. Never share the .env file.
